    "media:imagetext": "1991 CQWW Wake Island DXpedition\nWE5I/KH9\nWAKE ISLAND - A possession of the U.S. is a typical Pacific\ncoral atoll consisting of three islands - Wake Island, Wilkes\nAD1S/KH9\nIsland, and Peale Island connected by a bridge and a causeway.\nTotal landmass is about 2.5 square miles built up on a underwater\nvolcano.\nSpecial Thanks To:\nMajor Michael Koch, USAF\nJohn Beardshear, KB5LRO\nSSgt John Lang, USAF\nDet 4 15th Air Base Wing\nUSAF Military Airlift Command\nTom Russell, AH9AC\nKwajalein Amateur Radio Club\nKen Wells, V73CT\nSupport Group:\nWR5G, KG5MA, N5QKK, N5PVM, KAPSF, WN5J,\nN5DLM, N5QOR, N5MIH, W5CCP AND MARCIA\nConfirming QS0 with: AC2P\nQSL to: OKDXA\nBox 88\nWellston, OK 74881\nOKlahoma DX\nAssociation\n27-0ct-91 2208 UTC 10 2XSSB\n59\nOklahoma\nComm\nGenter\nco World Wide - Thanks QSL",
    "media:imagetext_created": 1787967568,
